1
00:05:06,315 --> 00:05:12,315
A romantic adventure for the dangerous at heart.

2
00:10:12,631 --> 00:10:18,631
Shanghai Surprise is a romance, adventure, crime film directed by Jim Goddard.

3
00:15:18,947 --> 00:15:24,947
Glendon Wasey is a fortune hunter looking for a fast track out of China.

4
00:20:25,263 --> 00:20:31,263
Gloria Tatlock is a missionary nurse seeking the
curing powers of opium for her patients.

5
00:25:31,578 --> 00:25:37,578
Fate sets them on a hectic, exotic, and even romantic quest for stolen drugs.

6
00:30:37,894 --> 00:30:43,894
But they are up against every thug and smuggler in Shangai.

7
00:35:44,210 --> 00:35:50,210
Glendon Wasey, played by Sean Penn.

8
00:40:50,526 --> 00:40:56,526
Gloria Tatlock, played by Madonna.

9
00:45:56,842 --> 00:46:02,842
Walter Faraday, played by Paul Freeman.

10
00:51:03,157 --> 00:51:09,157
Willie Tuttle, played by Richard Griffiths.

11
00:56:09,473 --> 00:56:15,473
Joe Go, played by Clyde Kusatsu.

12
01:01:15,789 --> 01:01:21,789
Justin Kronk, played by Philip Sayer.

13
01:06:22,105 --> 01:06:28,105
Shanghai Surprise is a 1986 adventure comedy film directed by Jim
Goddard and starring then-newlyweds Sean Penn and Madonna.

14
01:11:28,421 --> 01:11:34,421
The screenplay was adapted by John Kohn and Robert Bentley from
Tony Kenrick's 1978 novel Faraday's Flowers.

15
01:16:34,736 --> 01:16:40,736
Produced by George Harrison's HandMade Films and distributed by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, Harrison himself appears in
the film as a night club singer, and he wrote and recorded five original songs for the soundtrack.

16
01:21:41,052 --> 01:21:47,052
The film was a critical and commercial failure, and an
official soundtrack album was never released.

17
01:26:47,368 --> 01:26:53,368
The film explores themes of china, shanghai, china, american abroad.

18
01:31:53,684 --> 01:31:59,684
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
